  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "start",
      "label": "start of turn",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "opp_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[p.seat for p in players if p.seat != acting_seat][0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "won",
            "value": {
              "calc": "1 if (you.seat == acting_seat and you.points >= you.threshold) else you.won"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "action",
            "value": "pass"
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "chosen_card",
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "target_index",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "draw_count",
            "value": {
              "calc": "len(draw_pile)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "act_hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[p.hand for p in players if p.seat == acting_seat][0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "opp_view",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[p.point_pile_view for p in players if p.seat == opp_seat][0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "opp_pile",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[p.point_pile for p in players if p.seat == opp_seat][0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "card_opts",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[r for r in positions if int(r) >= point_ranks_min and int(r) <= point_ranks_max and r in act_hand]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "target_opts",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[positions[i] + ': ' + opp_view[i] for i in slots if i < len(opp_view)]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "action_opts",
            "value": {
              "calc": "['pass'] + (['draw'] if len(act_hand) < hand_limit_for_draw and len(draw_pile) > 0 else []) + (['points'] if len(card_opts) > 0 else []) + (['scuttle'] if len(card_opts) > 0 and len(opp_view) > 0 else []) + (['king_scuttle'] if positions[king_scuttle_rank - 1] in act_hand and sum([p.king_count for p in players if p.seat == opp_seat]) >= 1 else []) + (['jack'] if 'J' in act_hand and len(opp_view) > 0 else []) + (['king'] if 'K' in act_hand else [])"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "phase": "start",
      "label": "threshold reached",
      "when": {
        "calc": "any(p.won == 1 for p in players)"
      },
      "against": [
        "over"
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "start",
      "label": "public state",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Turn {turn} of {max_turns}: seat {acting_seat} to act. Seat 1: point pile {players[0].point_pile_view}, Kings {players[0].king_count}, threshold {players[0].threshold}, {players[0].hand_count} cards in hand. Seat 2: point pile {players[1].point_pile_view}, Kings {players[1].king_count}, threshold {players[1].threshold}, {players[1].hand_count} cards in hand. Scrap: {scrap}. Draw pile: {draw_count} cards."
    },
    {
      "use": "sync",
      "phase": "start",
      "label": "your hand",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == acting_seat"
      },
      "mode": "self",
      "fields": [
        "hand",
        "point_pile",
        "points",
        "threshold",
        "shortfall"
      ],
      "text": "Your hand and your exact point pile (D = face down, U = face up):"
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "action",
      "label": "choose an action",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == acting_seat"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "game": "action_opts"
        }
      },
      "each": {
        "do": [
          {
            "set": {
              "key": "action",
              "value": {
                "calc": "$answer if $answer in action_opts else 'pass'"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "Choose one action. draw: take the top card of the draw pile. points: put a point card face down in your point pile. scuttle: attack one card in the opponent's point pile with a point card. king_scuttle: play a 10 against one of the opponent's Kings. jack: play a Jack to take a card from the opponent's point pile. king: place a King. pass: do nothing (pass is only legal when you cannot draw; otherwise it still counts as a pass)."
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "action",
      "label": "choose a card",
      "when": {
        "calc": "action in ['points', 'scuttle']"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == acting_seat"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "game": "card_opts"
        }
      },
      "each": {
        "do": [
          {
            "set": {
              "key": "chosen_card",
              "value": {
                "calc": "$answer if $answer in card_opts else ''"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "key": "action",
              "value": "pass",
              "if": {
                "calc": "$answer not in card_opts"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "Which point card from your hand do you play?"
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "action",
      "label": "choose a target",
      "when": {
        "calc": "action in ['scuttle', 'jack']"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == acting_seat"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "game": "target_opts"
        }
      },
      "each": {
        "do": [
          {
            "set": {
              "key": "target_index",
              "value": {
                "calc": "sum([i + 1 for i in slots if i < len(target_opts) and target_opts[i] == $answer])"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "key": "action",
              "value": "pass",
              "if": {
                "calc": "target_index == 0"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "Which card in the opponent's point pile do you target? Each option is its position and its public view (band if face down, rank if face up)."
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "resolve",
      "label": "pass",
      "when": {
        "calc": "action == 'pass'"
      },
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Seat {acting_seat} passes."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "resolve",
      "label": "draw",
      "when": {
        "calc": "action == 'draw' and len(draw_pile) > 0 and len(act_hand) < hand_limit_for_draw"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "draw_pile[int(uniform(0, len(draw_pile)))]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "acting_seat"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "draw_pile",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "acting_seat"
            },
            "key": "hand_count",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "draw_count",
            "value": {
              "calc": "len(draw_pile)"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Seat {acting_seat} draws a card."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "resolve",
      "label": "points",
      "when": {
        "calc": "action == 'points' and chosen_card in card_opts"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "band",
            "value": {
              "calc": "'Low' if int(chosen_card) <= low_band_max else ('Mid' if int(chosen_card) <= mid_band_max else 'High')"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "acting_seat"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "chosen_card"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "acting_seat"
            },
            "key": "point_pile",
            "value": {
              "calc": "'D' + chosen_card"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "acting_seat"
            },
            "key": "point_pile_view",
            "value": {
              "calc": "band"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "acting_seat"
            },
            "key": "points",
            "value": {
              "calc": "int(chosen_card)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "acting_seat"
            },
            "key": "hand_count",
            "value": -1
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Seat {acting_seat} places a {band} card face down in their point pile."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "resolve",
      "label": "scuttle",
      "when": {
        "calc": "action == 'scuttle' and chosen_card in card_opts and target_index >= 1 and target_index <= len(opp_pile)"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "chosen_rank",
            "value": {
              "calc": "int(chosen_card)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "target_entry",
            "value": {
              "calc": "opp_pile[target_index - 1]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "target_rank",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sum([int(r) for r in positions if 'D' + r == target_entry or 'U' + r == target_entry])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "acting_seat"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "chosen_card"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "acting_seat"
            },
            "key": "hand_count",
            "value": -1
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "scrap",
            "value": {
              "calc": "chosen_card"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "opp_seat"
            },
            "key": "point_pile",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[opp_pile[i] for i in slots if i < len(opp_pile) and i != target_index - 1]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "chosen_rank >= target_rank"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "opp_seat"
            },
            "key": "point_pile_view",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[opp_view[i] for i in slots if i < len(opp_view) and i != target_index - 1]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "chosen_rank >= target_rank"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "opp_seat"
            },
            "key": "points",
            "value": {
              "calc": "-target_rank"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "chosen_rank >= target_rank"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "scrap",
            "value": {
              "calc": "positions[target_rank - 1]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "chosen_rank >= target_rank"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "opp_seat"
            },
            "key": "point_pile",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[('U' + positions[target_rank - 1]) if i == target_index - 1 else opp_pile[i] for i in slots if i < len(opp_pile)]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "chosen_rank < target_rank"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "opp_seat"
            },
            "key": "point_pile_view",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[positions[target_rank - 1] if i == target_index - 1 else opp_view[i] for i in slots if i < len(opp_view)]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "chosen_rank < target_rank"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Seat {acting_seat} scuttles with a {chosen_card} against position {target_index} of seat {opp_seat}'s point pile, which is a {target_rank}. If the attacker is equal or higher both went to scrap; otherwise only the attacker did and the target is now face up. Scrap: {scrap}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "resolve",
      "label": "king scuttle",
      "when": {
        "calc": "action == 'king_scuttle' and positions[king_scuttle_rank - 1] in act_hand and sum([p.king_count for p in players if p.seat == opp_seat]) >= 1"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "remove": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "acting_seat"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "positions[king_scuttle_rank - 1]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "acting_seat"
            },
            "key": "hand_count",
            "value": -1
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "scrap",
            "value": {
              "calc": "positions[king_scuttle_rank - 1]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "scrap",
            "value": "K"
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "opp_seat"
            },
            "key": "king_count",
            "value": -1
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "threshold",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[first_threshold_0k, first_threshold_1k, first_threshold_2k, first_threshold_3k, first_threshold_4k][you.king_count] if you.is_first else [second_threshold_0k, second_threshold_1k, second_threshold_2k, second_threshold_3k, second_threshold_4k][you.king_count]"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Seat {acting_seat} plays a 10 against one of seat {opp_seat}'s Kings. Both go to scrap."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "resolve",
      "label": "jack",
      "when": {
        "calc": "action == 'jack' and 'J' in act_hand and target_index >= 1 and target_index <= len(opp_pile)"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "target_entry",
            "value": {
              "calc": "opp_pile[target_index - 1]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "target_rank",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sum([int(r) for r in positions if 'D' + r == target_entry or 'U' + r == target_entry])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "acting_seat"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": "J"
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "acting_seat"
            },
            "key": "hand_count",
            "value": -1
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "scrap",
            "value": "J"
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "opp_seat"
            },
            "key": "point_pile",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[opp_pile[i] for i in slots if i < len(opp_pile) and i != target_index - 1]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "opp_seat"
            },
            "key": "point_pile_view",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[opp_view[i] for i in slots if i < len(opp_view) and i != target_index - 1]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "opp_seat"
            },
            "key": "points",
            "value": {
              "calc": "-target_rank"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "acting_seat"
            },
            "key": "point_pile",
            "value": {
              "calc": "'U' + positions[target_rank - 1]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "acting_seat"
            },
            "key": "point_pile_view",
            "value": {
              "calc": "positions[target_rank - 1]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "acting_seat"
            },
            "key": "points",
            "value": {
              "calc": "target_rank"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Seat {acting_seat} plays a Jack and takes position {target_index} of seat {opp_seat}'s point pile: a {target_rank}, now face up in seat {acting_seat}'s pile. The Jack goes to scrap."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "resolve",
      "label": "king",
      "when": {
        "calc": "action == 'king' and 'K' in act_hand"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "remove": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "acting_seat"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": "K"
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "acting_seat"
            },
            "key": "hand_count",
            "value": -1
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "acting_seat"
            },
            "key": "king_count",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "threshold",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[first_threshold_0k, first_threshold_1k, first_threshold_2k, first_threshold_3k, first_threshold_4k][you.king_count] if you.is_first else [second_threshold_0k, second_threshold_1k, second_threshold_2k, second_threshold_3k, second_threshold_4k][you.king_count]"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Seat {acting_seat} places a King."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "end",
      "label": "end of turn",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "threshold",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[first_threshold_0k, first_threshold_1k, first_threshold_2k, first_threshold_3k, first_threshold_4k][you.king_count] if you.is_first else [second_threshold_0k, second_threshold_1k, second_threshold_2k, second_threshold_3k, second_threshold_4k][you.king_count]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "shortfall",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max(you.threshold - you.points, shortfall_min)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "turn",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "acting_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "opp_seat"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "draw_count",
            "value": {
              "calc": "len(draw_pile)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "won",
            "value": {
              "calc": "1 if (turn > max_turns and you.shortfall == min([p.shortfall for p in players])) else you.won"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "phase": "end",
      "label": "after turn 40",
      "when": {
        "calc": "turn > max_turns"
      },
      "against": [
        "over"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "end": {
    "over": {
      "when": {
        "calc": "any(p.won == 1 for p in players) or turn > max_turns"
      },
      "rank_by": "you.won * 1000 - you.shortfall",
      "text": "Winner: {result}. Seat 1: points {players[0].points}, threshold {players[0].threshold}, shortfall {players[0].shortfall}. Seat 2: points {players[1].points}, threshold {players[1].threshold}, shortfall {players[1].shortfall}."
    }
  },
  "limits": {
    "rounds": 40,
    "rounds_max": 45,
    "actions_max": 1000,
    "deadline_s": 120
  },
  "rules": "DECK: {deck_size} cards: {point_cards} point cards (ranks {point_ranks_min} to {point_ranks_max}, {copies_per_rank} copies of each, no suits), {jacks} Jacks and {kings} Kings. The deck is shuffled.\n\nBANDS: Every point card has a band. Low is ranks 1-{low_band_max}, Mid is ranks {mid_band_min}-{mid_band_max}, High is ranks {high_band_min}-10.\n\nSETUP: A First player is picked at random. Each player is dealt {hand_deal} cards; hands are private. The other {draw_pile_start} cards are the face-down draw pile. The scrap pile is face up and fully public. Each player has a point pile (starting empty) and a King count (starting 0).\n\nTHRESHOLD: First player: {first_threshold_0k} with 0 Kings, {first_threshold_1k} with 1, {first_threshold_2k} with 2, {first_threshold_3k} with 3, {first_threshold_4k} with 4. Second player: {second_threshold_0k} with 0 Kings, {second_threshold_1k} with 1, {second_threshold_2k} with 2, {second_threshold_3k} with 3, {second_threshold_4k} with 4. Points are the sum of the ranks in your point pile. Shortfall is threshold minus points, with a minimum of {shortfall_min}.\n\nTURNS: Players alternate single turns, First player first. There are at most {max_turns} turns in total ({turns_each} each), numbered 1 to {max_turns}.\n\nSTART OF TURN: If the acting player's points are at or above their threshold right now, they win immediately. Otherwise everyone is shown the public state: each point pile as a list of cards (a face-down card shows its band, a face-up card its rank), both King counts and thresholds, the scrap pile, the draw pile size, both hand sizes and the turn number. The acting player also sees their own hand and the exact ranks of their own face-down cards.\n\nACTION: The acting player chooses exactly one of:\n(a) DRAW: take the top card of the draw pile. Not allowed if you hold {hand_limit_for_draw} cards or the pile is empty.\n(b) POINTS: place one point card from your hand face down in your point pile. Its band is visible to the opponent.\n(c) SCUTTLE: choose one point card from your hand and one card in the opponent's point pile, and reveal both. If your rank is equal to or higher than the target's rank, both go to scrap (and the opponent loses the target's points). Otherwise your card goes to scrap and the target stays in place, now face up.\n(d) KING-SCUTTLE: play a {king_scuttle_rank} from your hand against an opponent's King. Both go to scrap and the opponent's King count falls by 1 (their threshold rises back to the table value).\n(e) JACK: play a Jack from your hand and choose any card in the opponent's point pile. It moves to your point pile face up, and the Jack goes to scrap.\n(f) KING: place a King from your hand. Your King count rises by 1 and your threshold drops to the next table value.\n(g) PASS: allowed only if you cannot draw.\nAn illegal or unparseable choice counts as PASS, and nothing changes.\n\nEND: After turn {max_turns}, the player with the smaller shortfall wins. Equal shortfalls are a draw (the result is shared)."
}
